 no longer shrinks on large monitors and fits on small ones, anxiety warns you more clearly before it starts draining health, and the light near the crib and wells is softer. Quests Main quests now come one after another: \"To the Crib","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T19:10:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030061","verified_at":"2026-10-21T19:53:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5002170-1846651706694817","game_id":"steam-5002170","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.2.4: Fortune Teller and Ruined Well","summary":"This patch adds a fortune-telling ball with cards and a ruined well with a special quest to the forest, gives the characters clear stats, and quest rewards are now handed out in their own window. Fortune-telling ball A fortune-telling ball stands in one of the forest clearings, and an arrow at the edge of the screen points to it. While the hero stands next to the ball, the world around freezes. Walk up to the ball and press the action button to play with the fortune teller. Each card costs 100 c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:14:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694817","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5002170-1846018067936390","game_id":"steam-5002170","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.2.3 - chests, a new quest and more enemies","summary":"Hi!This patch makes chest rewards more exciting to receive, adds arrows pointing to chests on the map and a new quest, and puts more enemies into a run.ChestsA chest reward used to simply appear on screen. I reworked this moment so that every chest feels like an event.The reward is now revealed step by step: icons of possible rewards replace one another, slow down and stop on the one you get.The reveal comes with new sounds and sparks around the icon, and when the reward is decided, a burst of s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T14:20:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936390","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5002170-1845383656393440","game_id":"steam-5002170","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.2.2 - the main monster now comes to you","summary":"Hi!This patch changes how a run ends. Many players ran out of time before finding the main monster or didn't know where to go, so I reworked the ending: the monster now comes to the hero on its own when time runs out.Main monsterThe main monster appears on its own when the countdown at the top of the screen reaches zero. Until then, you can calmly grow stronger and get ready for the fight.A minute before it appears, the timer starts blinking and the hero warns you that the monster is getting clo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T13:12:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656393440","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5002170-1844751498235456","game_id":"steam-5002170","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.2.1: Quests and Five New Attacks","summary":"This update adds quests to every run and five new attacks, so each run plays out differently and there is more to fight for than just survival.QuestsI added quests that appear during a run.Every run gives you three random quests from different categories. Quests don't repeat from your previous run, and completing them earns you coins, so you can save up for attack upgrades faster and clear the level quicker or on a higher difficulty.Every run also has two permanent quests: run to the crib at the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T21:00:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498235456","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5002170-1844751498227121","game_id":"steam-5002170","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 0.2.0: difficulty levels, new characters and tutorial","summary":"The Dreamfend demo has received update 0.2.0!This patch brings a number of changes so that players with little experience can settle into the world of Dreamfend without dying at the very start of a run.Difficulty- I added difficulty levels when choosing a level: there are now easy, normal and hard modes. If the game feels too easy and boring, raise the difficulty, and if it's too hard, lower it.- Rewards differ between difficulty levels, so harder levels are more rewarding and you can grow your ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T12:19:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498227121","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5002170-1844115010501287","game_id":"steam-5002170","kind":"announcement","title":"The Dreamfend Demo is here!","summary":"The demo is finally live!You can now download and play the Dreamfend demo for free. Run through fights, defeat the final boss, unlock rewards and new attacks, and spend upgrade points on ability branches. Mix and match weapons and passives — and see what the full game is shaping up to be.This is still an early build, so if you run into any bugs, rough edges, or things that just don't feel right — I'd genuinely love to hear about it. And if you've got ideas on where the game could go next, I'm al","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T12:52:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010501287","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5002170":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:10Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5002170":"2026-10-26T07:13:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5002170":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:10Z"},"5187940":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:10Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5002170","app_id":5002170,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:16Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"9d83297600005ade5cdafaade24d1d62880f84326869014d786e162e727398e9","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Dreamfend is a pixel-art roguelite survivor where you play as an old teddy bear guarding a sleeping child from nightmares. Fight off swarms of monsters, collect and upgrade weapons, find power-ups, hunt down every boss and survive the night. Just don't lose yourself — and don't lose the child.","publishers":[{"name":"Lapchatka"}],"developers":[{"name":"Lapchatka"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796043600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full","is_early_access":true},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"dreamfend promo 001","t